    },
    "axis": {
      "description": "Board axis along which the sequence runs.",
      "minimum": 0,
      "title": "Axis",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "sequence": {
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "minItems": 1,
      "title": "Sequence",
      "type": "array"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "start",
    "axis",
    "sequence"
  ],
  "title": "SubmittedMove",
  "type": "object"
}

Return exactly one JSON object and nothing else. Example shape:
{"start": [0, 0], "axis": 0, "sequence": ["A", "D", "I"]}
